      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_62",
        on: "meet_yannic",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Who commands this garrison? Time is short. We must evacuate what’s left of your men before—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Yannic",
            text: _("Owaec? Is that you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Yannic?! Well met friend, I haven’t seen you in years!! Ha, you never could stay out of trouble! How’s your horse, Clansman?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Yannic",
            text: _("Injured, along with those few of my men lucky enough to yet live. I am more than grateful for your timely arrival and help."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Speaking of help, we require yours. I, the King’s High Advisor, seek a powerful magic east of the Listra to destroy these undead. We will require your men and provisions for the journey."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Yannic",
            text: _("... I would gladly offer all for the friend of a fellow Clansman, but as you can see, myself and what remains of my garrison are in little condition to help anyone. Still, should I encounter any fresh reinforcements or objects of interest, I will send them your way."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Acceptable."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Bah, we come to aid you, not to seek <i>your</i> aid! We shall do our utmost to ensure you and your men survive this dark time."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "met_yannic",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
        ],
      },
